sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant S as Service
    participant W as Worker
    U->>+S: request
    S->>+S: validate input
    S->>W: enqueue job
    activate W
    W-->>S: accepted
    S->>S: log it
    W->>W: crunch numbers for a while
    deactivate W
    S-->>-U: done
    deactivate S
    U-->S: bye
